    {
      "id": "auth-state-changed-broadcast",
      "type": "otel-event",
      "x": 975,
      "y": 57,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "label": "Auth State Changed",
      "icon": "Radio",
      "shape": "roundedRect",
      "description": "Broadcast auth-state:changed IPC event to all renderer processes",
      "event": {
        "name": "auth.state.changed",
        "attributes": {
          "is_authenticated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": true,
            "description": "New authentication status (false after logout)"
          },
          "user": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": false,
            "description": "User object (null after logout)"
          },
          "last_checked": {
            "type": "number",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Timestamp of state change"
          }
        }
      },
      "otel": {
        "status": "draft",
        "scope": "principal-ade-main",
        "files": [
          "src/main/services/AuthStateManager.ts",
          "src/shared/ipc-events/AuthEvents.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ui-logout-complete",
      "type": "otel-event",
      "x": 1236,
      "y": 57,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "label": "UI Updated",
      "icon": "RefreshCw",
      "shape": "roundedRect",
      "description": "UI components receive auth state change and update",
      "event": {
        "name": "auth.ui.updated",
        "attributes": {
          "component": {
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Component that updated (FeedLeftPanel, NavigationSidebar, etc)"
          },
          "previous_state.authenticated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Previous auth state"
          },
          "new_state.authenticated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": true,
            "description": "New auth state (false)"
          }
        }
      },
      "otel": {
        "status": "draft",
        "scope": "principal-ade-principal-window",
        "files": [
          "src/renderer/hooks/useAuthState.ts",
          "src/renderer/panels/FeedLeftPanel.tsx"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logout-success-validation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 985,
      "y": -148,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#D4EDDA",
      "text": "## Success Validation\n\n✅ Both tokens deleted from keychain\n✅ AuthStateManager.isAuthenticated = false\n✅ Auth state change event broadcast\n✅ UI shows signed-out state\n✅ Git credentials removed\n\n**Query:** Check all logout events succeeded:\n```\nSELECT * FROM events \nWHERE name IN (\n  'auth.token.deleted',\n  'auth.state.cleared'\n)\nAND attributes.success = true\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "logout-error-silent-failure",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 285,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#F8D7DA",
      "text": "## 🐛 Known Issue: Silent Failure\n\n**Problem:** Token deletion errors are caught and logged but not thrown\n\n```typescript\ncatch (error) {\n  console.error('[AuthService] Failed to clear');\n  // Don't throw - issue!\n}\n```\n\n**Impact:** Logout returns success even if tokens not deleted\n\n**Causes:**\n- Keychain locked during logout\n- Keychain timeout (30s)\n- Permission denied\n- App force-quit mid-logout"
    },
    {
      "id": "logout-error-stale-data",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1211,
      "y": 301,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#F8D7DA",
      "text": "## 🐛 Issue: Stale UI Data\n\n**Problem:** Components using local state instead of useAuth() show stale data\n\n**Example:** FeedLeftPanel was fetching user once on mount, never updated on auth changes\n\n**Solution:** All components must use `useAuth()` hook to subscribe to auth state changes\n\n**Fixed in:** FeedLeftPanel.tsx now uses useAuth()"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-cache-clear",
      "type": "otel-event",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -83,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "label": "Memory Cache Cleared",
      "icon": "Trash2",
      "shape": "roundedRect",
      "description": "Clear UnifiedSecureStorage in-memory cache after token deletion",
      "event": {
        "name": "auth.cache.cleared",
        "attributes": {
          "cache.size_before": {
            "type": "number",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Number of items in cache before clear"
          },
          "cache.tokens_removed": {
            "type": "number",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Number of tokens removed from cache"
          }
        }
      },
      "otel": {
        "status": "draft",
        "scope": "principal-ade-main",
        "files": [
          "src/main/services/UnifiedSecureStorage.ts"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
